flowchart TD
  start[Request or scheduled job]
  gate{Feature flag / credentials enabled?}
  hosting[Cloudflare / Vercel / Render managed edge and hosting]
  db[(PostgreSQL)]
  redis[(Redis)]
  market[Market-data provider]
  news[News provider]
  mail[SendGrid / Brevo]
  hf[Hugging Face model load]
  sentry[Sentry]
  gh[GitHub Actions]
  backup[Backup script / S3]
  telemetry[Google Analytics / Vercel Analytics]
  api[API response]
  cacheFallback[LocMemCache fallback]
  noData[Disabled / unavailable data response]
  emailConsole[Console email output]
  noModel[Prediction unavailable]
  noBackup[No verified backup / restore]
  noAlert[No alert/rollback evidence]

  start --> hosting
  hosting -->|Origin/CDN failure| noData
  hosting -->|Request reaches app| api
  start --> gate
  gate -->|Flag false or credential absent| noData
  gate -->|Enabled| db
  db -->|Connection error| noData
  start --> redis
  redis -->|Not configured in live health| cacheFallback
  cacheFallback -->|Single-process only| api
  start --> market
  market -->|Timeout / quota / provider error| noData
  start --> news
  news -->|Flag disabled or provider failure| noData
  start --> mail
  mail -->|SendGrid constructor TypeError| mail
  mail -->|Brevo key absent| emailConsole
  mail -->|SMTP failure| emailConsole
  start --> hf
  hf -->|Download/model error| noModel
  start --> sentry
  sentry -->|DSN absent / event dropped| noAlert
  start --> gh
  gh -->|Scheduled command no-op or workflow failure| noAlert
  start --> backup
  backup -->|pg_dump host/path/command issue or no schedule| noBackup
  start --> telemetry
  telemetry -->|Consent/blocking/provider failure| noAlert
  noData --> api
  noModel --> api
  emailConsole --> api

  %% No durable task queue, dead-letter queue, backup restore test or automatic deployment rollback was found.
